[statement]
apk reads the world's names before the installed database's: the world
mentions `kb2304` and the installed `zref` mentions `ka`, so `ka` is read
last and installed first. With the installed database read first, `kb2304`
would be.

[repository]
P:base
V:1

P:ka
V:1
i:base

P:kb2304
V:1
i:base

[installed]
P:zref
V:1
i:ka

[world]
!kb2304>5
zref

[request]
base

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install ka 1
install kb2304 1
